{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ坂ですっすっ❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/17/6747649/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、乃木どこ収録でしたー(*^^*)‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々にスタジオ収録でねたーのしかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/17/6747649/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と同時に乃木どこもやってたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/17/6747649/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後から録画したの観て思ったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通、人って一生懸命な姿ってかっこ良いものじゃない？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみって一生懸命に何かやってもなんかどーもキマらないというかどんくさいというか.........笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/17/6747649/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"客観的に観ると必死すぎて変な事言ってるし走り方変だしビックリした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"╭(๑¯⌓¯๑)╮ ...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未、まだまだ頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/17/6747649/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこにこにっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.「アイリス」イ・ビョンホンさんの韓国ＴＶドラマ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そうだよーー！観て観て♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、自己ＰＲ、何を披露するの？お笑いっすか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の笑いをさらっちゃう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気の演技でお客をうならせちゃう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ、最終的にやったのが、モノマネと、シェイクスピアの真夏の夜の夢のワンシーンを本気でやったよ(^ ^)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみ族って、家族で入っていいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.大歓迎!!!みんなであみのこと応援してね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、能條さんの握手行ってもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.おいでーーー！待ってるよ❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみがまあやと写真とったのをアップしたのはじめてだよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん始めてかも！！まあや好きーー(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、何を叫んでるのでしょうか？差し支えなければ教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えっと、「腹へったーーー」って感じかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、とりあえず能條さん呼びしてます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて呼べばいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.能條さんでもいいよん！あみあみでもいいし♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、ようやく１６人に選ばれましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際、舞台で演じて見てどうでした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想待ってるよーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.舞台って最高に素敵な場所だなって思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出れなかったメンバーの気持ちも背負って本気で演じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、まだ一度しか握手してないけど立派なあみあみ族として認知されたとおもってたけどあと２回行かないと覚えてもらえないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ、そんなことないよー！あみの握手きてね↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、あみあみの好きな男の人の髪型＋髪色はなーに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ワックスでふんわりさせて、ほんのり茶色な感じ好きよ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、2幕での笑顔すごい良かったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台から見た風景はどうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.お客様の顔がすごく楽しそうでこっちまで幸せな気持ちになった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、愛未が告白されるとしたら、理想のシチュエーションは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ベタな感じも好きだよ？いきなり呼びだされてーとか。うん、どんなシチュエーションでも告白なんてされたら嬉しいでしょ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.次回の機会であみあみの個握に行ったとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし『モノマネやって！』ってお願いしたらやってくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もちろんやるよお！！でもなんかお題を言ってくれた方がやりやすい(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、この舞台で一番思い出になこったことあるー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.千秋楽のアンコール全て終わって、はけた時にみんなで泣きながら抱き合ったあの瞬間かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、チーム能條のメンバーって誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ちはるんこと斎藤ちはる、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんこと齋藤あすかと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみこと能條愛未です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、飛鳥と姉妹だそうですがどちらがお姉さんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（精神年齢で）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.飛鳥もなかなか精神年齢は高いとは思いますがここはさすがに高校3年にもなって飛鳥より幼いのは情けないので。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條が姉でお願いします。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、学校でのランチは お弁当？（ママ特製？） 学食派？ 特に決まっていなくてその日による？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ほとんどママの特製弁当だよ！たまーに購買でパン買って食べる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日な(*^^*)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/17/6747649/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とらわれた宇宙人。ねね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とらえた宇宙人。あみ、ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}